### Helena Gil-Buitrago

**PhD student**

[15:27] Helena Gil Buitrago
Helena is a PhD student in Neuroscience at the Autonomous University of Barcelona (UAB). She received her Bachelor’s in Psychology in 2022 and her Master’s degree in Neuroscience in 2023, also at the UAB. Her research interests include assessing the neural effects of Human-Computer Interaction (HCI) and how it influences cognitive and emotional processes. She is currently investigating the neural and psychological responses to social robots in Human-Robot Interactions (HRI). 
